# Implementation Plan - INDUSTRIAL REMOTE MIRRORING (v2.2.1)

The `git pull` on your VM failed due to credential requirements. I will now bypass Git entirely and use `scp` to mirror the verified 'Deadlock-Free' code directly from your local machine to the VM.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Code Mirroring Phase:** I will use your SSH key to push the files from `/home/eisen/Downloads/SQAuto` to `azureuser@172.188.112.192:~/SQAuto`. This ensures the VM has the **exact** same stable code I just verified.

> [!CAUTION]
